• What trigger mechanism is most appropriate for this product — heat, electrical current, chemical, or mechanical?
• At what temperature or energy threshold should the embedded disassembly activate, and is this safely above normal operating conditions?
• Can the embedded disassembly mechanism be reset or replaced for reassembly?
• What is the cost of incorporating smart materials relative to the savings in disassembly time and labour?
• Are the embedded smart materials compatible with the product's operational environment?